99618252_24941930315501166_5630600238007271378_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Se1ibrRzJO0Q7kNvwHKknNS&_nc_oc=AdqDY4PGgxgUlqte4zBVcsnb2bS4d5HhSWLIYetGktdQOUy50aWEeT6y0gNLEn8sCi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDkiatm6g9uMlS52MrvK3x6-qCR-Rm0IfX8YJX8DUGGMQ&oe=6A5A3FF0"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1164452051868170", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_1164452058534836_8680613022875370471_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y6UsjktHHiAQ7kNvwEjMx0-&_nc_oc=AdrcFtB9PG6Sqht91oBiNdF2pmxfkYoagnzNzeBkCjRi8AqU8iQ3RczNeviNm_Sg5XA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQACiIaUTzlbQVk-9KKyKWTYWQz2qs4lBTXA6p-s0jT4XA&oe=6A5A2A6D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "835846522507208", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618039_835846525840541_3349035754661619138_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NI9_LyrjM9cQ7kNvwG0GExa&_nc_oc=AdpRm42Y88fDefkfO88vSpnZylrr4So3ADuAXShQgHMhlGK-Yrhh6IzNAfuQxOlV9LI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAIBcuOrYKAesH5r1iAJkD5C-mNXygMlDwZofd1lmITgg&oe=6A5A170F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PaintedRealms_CoverImageLandscape.png", "id": "1242734424538306", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1242734427871639_7320096193581072004_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qBhvTt_R85wQ7kNvwGnZEoO&_nc_oc=AdpP-N7eiAih3-W2rgttvvxChLdXbudu84RYAiA9hzRVKHTSYY7QkWkbZTYBB90h3ow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBdozrL7TaDovZlxcD_GPUiJ0IENf69KFci2bxaiEJxJQ&oe=6A5A13B3"}, "display_name": "Painted Realms Demo", "keywords": ["cozy", "painting", "wholesome", "art", "sandbox"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udc7e Share your creations with us on **Discord**: https://discord.gg/dH8uKv7tm7 \ud83d\udc7e\n\n# Join the Restorers !\n\nIn the magical Coquelicot Museum, paintings are portals towards living worlds ! Play as an art restorer and use your brushes to save the painted realms from a mysterious Eraser Artist. **This is a demo version.**\n\n**Immersive art** - Rediscover the most famous paintings as immersive 3D worlds\n{2020461498710789}\n\n**Restoration** - Find the differences between the flat originals and the immersive paintings and paint everything back to normal\n{854306483740831}\n\n**Creative freedom** - Help the visitors of the museum with creative quests and wake up your inner artist\n{1376429067462623}\n\n**Sandbox** - Customize the museum with fun and easy to use art tools, such as the magical brush that turns 2D drawings into 3D objects !\n{1562077004939594}\n\n\n# Demo vs. Full Game\n\nThis demo version is a short, first-taste of the complete game. Here what you can expect from the full game :\n\n**More content** - The full game will be a 5-hour long adventure : explore multiple museum galleries and immersive paintings ; meet new inhabitants of the painted realms and complete dozens of creative quests.\n\n**New Social mode** - Invite your friends in your museum with the multiplayer mode, show your art and paint together ! Share your creations easily with social media integrations.\n\n**More creative tools** - More fancy brushes, a color-swap gun, a magic drawing machine... It'll be easier and funnier to customize your museum and to do the creative side quests.\n\nJoin us on Discord : https://discord.gg/dH8uKv7tm7\n", "short_description": "Play as an art restorer. Step inside famous paintings, turn drawings into 3D objects and save the museum from a mysterious Eraser Artist !\n\n*This is a demo version* "}]}, "developer_name": "wondie games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wondiegames.com/#privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AIO Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://paintedrealmsgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", 